{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんにちぴょんっひなぴょんっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"コメントありがとよんっ(*´∀｀*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"スーツのお姉さん(14)！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2013/02/25/1800984/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"中学3年生14歳\n私は、初めてスーツを着たのだっ(´-ω-。`)♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"将来、スーツが似合う綺麗なお姉さんになるのだ！！！にっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"せくすぃーな髪型にしたぜっ！！陽菜蜜やねん(」・ω・)！！←"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"***"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は、オフでした！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なので、秋葉原に行ってきたぜっ！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"友達とねっ(。・ω・。)+.*"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"友達は初秋葉原ってことで案内"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"っっって、川後は長崎出身！！！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"友達の方が知っているはずなのに(´-ω-`)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ってことで、案内人は川後陽菜。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"秋葉原観光ツアー！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"歩行者天国やああ(」・ω・)(」・ω・)うぇいっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まず、メイド喫茶(。・ω・。)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"++案内人ひなぴょんガイド++"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"左をご覧下さい。メイド喫茶です。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"メイド喫茶とは、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"愛と萌と癒しをお届けするために"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"食べ物に美味しくなるビームを飛ばす行為や\n萌え萌えにさせる術を持つ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"正義の味方、、、超魔術師、、、超絶可愛い天使"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"がお世話してくれる場であります！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"+++"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"2回目の来店(*°∀°)=3"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まず、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"メイドさん「お名前は？」\nひな「ひなです」\nメイド「ひなおじょうさまですね！